<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia's Ganz Tech stock suspended.</title>
<headline>Malaysia's Ganz Tech stock suspended.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The stock of Ganz Technologies Bhd was suspended on Friday afternoon at the request of the company, an official at the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>Officials at the maker of gloves could not immediately be reached for comment.</p>
<p>The company's stock rose 1.70 to 19.60 ringgit prior to the suspension.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
